<title>USA: H&amp;R Block to buy Option One from Fleet.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block to buy Option One from Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>H&amp;R Block Inc said its Block Financial unit agreed to buy Option One Mortgage Corp from Fleet Financial Group for $190 million in cash.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed by the end of June and is subject to customary approvals and conditions, Block said.</p>
<p>Option One, based in Santa Ana, Calif., originates sub-prime mortgage loans.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
